    "q-78797": {
      "dom_id": "step-q78797",
      "name": "Question 12",
      "problem": "The inverse of the matrix $F$ is found using row operations, as shown below. What are the row operations corresponding to each step?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[F\\,|\\,I] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 2 & 1 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :=\\text{___________} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 5 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=\\text{___________} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 5 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 5 & -\\frac{2}{3} & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "We write down $F$ and the identity matrix $I$ side-by-side (as shown below) and apply the standard Gauss-Jordan method to transform the matrix $F$ into the identity matrix. We perform the same row operations on both matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[F\\,|\\,I] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 2 & 1 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+5{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 5 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & 5 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 5 & -\\frac{2}{3} & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding row operations are\n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+5{R}_{1},\\,{R}_{2}:=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{2}.\n$$\n\nThe matrix ${F}^{-1}$ is given by the right-hand side of our big matrix after all of the transformations have been completed. Therefore, \n\n$$\n{F}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{3} & 0 \\\\ 5 & -\\frac{2}{3} & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-78797-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "${R}_{3}:={R}_{2}+(-5){R}_{1}$\n$\\,\\text{and}\\,$\n${R}_{2}:=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{3}$",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"175\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>:=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"176\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace st